===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{senseid|en|Q33946}}{{lb|en|historical}} {{place|en|former country|in central|cont/Europe}}; now the [[Czech Republic]] and [[Slovakia]].
#* {{quote-av
|en
|url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e_mqZEuagHw
|year=1968
|title=The President: August 1968. MP899 (1280x720)
|work={{w|Lyndon Baines Johnson Library and Museum}}
|author=President {{w|Lyndon Johnson}}
|time=18:22
}}
#*: The tragic news from '''Czechoslovakia''' shocks the conscience of the world. The Soviet Union and its allies have invaded a defenseless country to stamp out a resurgence of ordinary human freedom. It is a sad commentary on the communist mind, that a sign of liberty in '''Czechoslovakia''' is deemed a fundamental threat to the security of the Soviet system. The {{w|Warsaw Pact invasion of Czechoslovakia|action of the Warsaw Pact allies}} is in flat violation of the United Nations charter. We are consulting urgently with others to consider what steps should be undertaken in the United Nations. Meanwhile, in the name of mankind's hope for peace, I call on the Soviet Union and its associates to withdraw their troops from '''Czechoslovakia'''.

